              "value": "(acid, evocation, primal)\n\nThe irlgaunt violently regurgitates a melonsized clot of brittle stone supernaturally infused with digestive enzymes. The stone and acid explode on impact within a range of 30 feet, dealing 7d6 piercing damage and 7d6 acid damage to creatures in a 20-foot burst (33 basic Reflex save). The irlgaunt can't Regurgitate Gastroliths for 1d4 rounds."
